#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:5 736b33be59e34c9fa85565bcb78afbbc
msgid "ZigZag Mode"
msgstr "ZigZag 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:7 9393f174ef994e1e843ad7d3de24bdda
msgid ""
"ZigZag mode is a semi-autonomous mode designed to make it easier for a pilot"
" to fly a vehicle back and forth across a field which can be useful for crop"
" spraying"
msgstr "ZigZag 模式是一种半自主模式，旨在让飞手更轻松地驾驶飞行器在田间来回飞行，非常适合农药喷洒作业"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:12 5a225c07920849deb8488429ee3f7acc
msgid "The way it works is:"
msgstr "其工作原理如下："

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:14 c91b8348997948e7a3ac01e66d7b2c39
msgid ""
"A two or three position :ref:`auxiliary switch <channel-7-and-8-options>` is"
" set to 61 / \"ZigZag SaveWP\" (i.e. :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 61)"
msgstr ""
"将一个两档或三档 :ref:`辅助开关 <channel-7-and-8-options>` 设置为 61 / 「ZigZag SaveWP」（即 "
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 61）"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:15 4e24641a060d4295a976e310aaea9ff9
msgid ""
"The pilot arms the vehicle and takes off.  The vehicle will fly just like "
":ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`"
msgstr "飞手解锁飞行器并起飞。飞行器将像 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 模式一样飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:16 991cd78497a7439faa22c6d00a7687dc
msgid ""
"The vehicle is flown manually to one side of the field and then the "
"auxiliary switch is moved to the highest or lowest position (it doesn't "
"matter which) to record that side"
msgstr "手动飞到田地一侧，然后将辅助开关拨到最高或最低位置（哪个方向均可）以记录该侧"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:17 143722045ebb40599d8a79bff749668d
msgid ""
"The vehicle is flown to the other side of the field and the switch is moved "
"to the opposite position"
msgstr "将飞行器飞到田地另一侧，并将开关拨到相反位置"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:18 11857dce9bfa43e5ac131790af30d225
msgid ""
"The switch can now be used to start the vehicle flying autonomously (at the "
"current height) to either side of the field.  Once the vehicle reaches the "
"other side it will revert to manual control.  The pilot can also regain "
"manual control by moving the auxiliary switch to the middle position or by "
"changing the flight mode."
msgstr ""
"现在可以使用开关启动飞行器自主飞行（保持当前高度）到田地任意一侧。飞行器到达另一侧后将恢复手动控制。飞手也可以通过将辅助开关拨至中间位置或切换飞行模式来重新获得手动控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:19 1ccd8c3048594cd9856f255a43395b95
msgid ""
"If a downward facing :ref:`range finder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` is"
" used, the vehicle will follow the terrain when flying.  If the range finder"
" becomes unhealthy while traversing from one side to the other, the vehicle "
"will revert to manual control and come to a stop."
msgstr ""
"如果使用朝下的 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>`，飞行器在飞行时将跟随地形。如果测距仪在穿越过程中出现故障，飞行器将恢复手动控制并停下来。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:25 c9b42fb5b9884651bedca193a85ec191
msgid ""
"When flown manually ZigZag uses :ref:`Loiter mode's <loiter-mode>`  "
"parameters.  For example the top speed can be configured with "
":ref:`LOIT_SPEED <LOIT_SPEED>`."
msgstr ""
"手动飞行时，ZigZag 使用 :ref:`Loiter 模式 <loiter-mode>` 的参数。例如，最高速度可通过 "
":ref:`LOIT_SPEED <LOIT_SPEED>` 配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:27 396b8fbb5c7f4816a1be71c227fcce28
msgid ""
"When autonomously flying from one side of the field to the other, the "
":ref:`Auto mode <auto-mode>` parameters are used.  For example the top speed"
" can be configured with :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED <WPNAV_SPEED>`.."
msgstr ""
"自主从田地一侧飞到另一侧时，使用 :ref:`Auto 模式 <auto-mode>` 的参数。例如，最高速度可通过 :ref:`WPNAV_SPEED"
" <WPNAV_SPEED>` 配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:32 6820248d2e2b41639d37cfda55332388
msgid "Automatic Operation"
msgstr "自动操作"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:34 d974ce97544141f7aee84cae3c2ea97c
msgid "This feature will be available in Copter-4.1.0"
msgstr "此功能将在 Copter-4.1.0 中可用"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:36 8c74c119ccf64ab397e89815d171ad4c
msgid ""
"this function must be enabled with :ref:`ZIGZ_AUTO_ENABLE<ZIGZ_AUTO_ENABLE>`"
" = 1, and parameters reloaded, before any parameters are visible and the "
"feature enabled."
msgstr ""
"此功能必须通过 :ref:`ZIGZ_AUTO_ENABLE<ZIGZ_AUTO_ENABLE>` = 1 "
"启用，并重新加载参数，才能使相关参数可见并使功能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:38 1264e6f1f3c64dc5a5a2004fc7bfa39e
msgid ""
"After the field's side points are registered, if you have an RC switch "
"configured with ``RCx_OPTION`` = 83 (ZigZag Auto Mode), you can "
"automatically cover the field side to side at a programmable distance "
"interval, also enabling a sprayer, if equipped."
msgstr ""
"注册好田地侧边点后，如果您已将 RC 开关配置为 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 83（ZigZag Auto "
"Mode），则可以按可编程的距离间隔自动覆盖田地两侧，并在配备喷洒器时自动启用喷洒。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:43 8a021b8d56e14ee990e2d8b1666d4448
msgid "To use:"
msgstr "使用方法："

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:45 e0369b839b954506bf08de7a238c91bb
msgid ""
"Fly to one side of the field and register the ZigZagWP A, as above, then fly"
" to ZigZagWP B and set it."
msgstr "飞到田地一侧并注册 ZigZagWP A（如上所述），然后飞到 ZigZagWP B 并设置它。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:46 9a7193a70bd145efa749c2e5e2bc1326
msgid ""
"Then switch the ZigZag Auto Mode switch you had setup. The vehicle will "
"proceed as shown in the diagram, automatically enabling a sprayer, if setup."
" See :ref:`sprayer` for instructions."
msgstr ""
"然后切换您设置的 ZigZag Auto Mode 开关。飞行器将按图示进行飞行，并在配备喷洒器时自动启用。请参阅 :ref:`sprayer` "
"获取使用说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:47 88e90901328b4760ab902d1ba108ce13
msgid ""
"Upon activation, the vehicle will move in "
":ref:`ZIGZ_DIRECTION<ZIGZ_DIRECTION>` with respect to its heading for "
":ref:`ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST<ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST>`, then proceed to cross the field until"
" the opposite ZigZagWP is reached. It will then wait for "
":ref:`ZIGZ_WP_DELAY<ZIGZ_WP_DELAY>` to allow sprayer to fully stop and then "
"move :ref:`ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST<ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST>` down the side of the field again "
"to proceed back across the area. It will do this for "
":ref:`ZIGZ_LINE_NUM<ZIGZ_LINE_NUM>` times (-1 = infinite until switched out "
"of this mode, =0 will only move to the first field crossing position, but "
"not proceed further)."
msgstr ""
"激活后，飞行器将相对于其航向沿 :ref:`ZIGZ_DIRECTION<ZIGZ_DIRECTION>` 方向移动 "
":ref:`ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST<ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST>` 距离，然后穿越田地直至到达另一侧的 ZigZagWP。之后等待 "
":ref:`ZIGZ_WP_DELAY<ZIGZ_WP_DELAY>` 时间以使喷洒器完全停止，再沿田地侧边移动 "
":ref:`ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST<ZIGZ_SIDE_DIST>` 距离，继续返回穿越该区域。将执行 "
":ref:`ZIGZ_LINE_NUM<ZIGZ_LINE_NUM>` 次（-1 = 无限次直到切出此模式，= 0 "
"则仅移动到第一个穿越位置，不再继续）。"

#: ../../source/docs/zigzag-mode.rst:49 423f2aa30c6b4d32b31726647279f648
msgid ""
"Moving the ZigZag Auto switch to the low position immediately stops this "
"mode and returns to normal ZIGZAG mode."
msgstr "将 ZigZag Auto 开关拨至低位可立即停止此模式并返回正常 ZigZag 模式。"
